llparse
https://github.com/nodejs/llparse

byte-machine's design follows llparse's model of a parser as a generated,
resumable, byte-at-a-time state machine. No llparse code is included.


Chez Scheme
https://github.com/cisco/ChezScheme

byte-machine is built and tested with Chez Scheme (Apache License 2.0). Chez
Scheme is a toolchain requirement and is not distributed with byte-machine;
generated parsers depend only on the R6RS base library and byte-machine's own
runtime library.
